   "headline": "Jensen Huang is back: Nvidia's board reinstates him as CEO",
   "fact": "Nvidia's board voted unanimously to reinstate Jensen Huang as president, CEO and board member, effective immediately \u2014 11 days after his resignation. The board said it had received input from senior levels of the U.S. government and is confident his return poses no national security risk; its independent investigation continues, Colette Kress returns to the CFO role, and President Trump called the move \u201cthe correct and proper decision.\u201d",
   "source": "Reuters",
   "url": "https://www.reuters.com/technology/nvidia-reinstates-jensen-huang-ceo-2026-11-23/"
  },
  {
   "tag": "US",
   "headline": "Huang's return ignites a historic rally: Nasdaq +6.7%, Nvidia +33%",
   "fact": "By mid-morning the Nasdaq Composite was up 6.7%, the S&P 500 4.7% and the Dow 2.8%, with Nvidia up about 33% \u2014 on course for its biggest one-day gain in 23 years \u2014 as Friday's correction reversed in a single session and the VIX fell back to 28.",
